    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: RightJunctionForward
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: RightJunctionForward
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: Ah! Look at you!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6e14f75895b43416bb034a2963841c90, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: You know your way around the hotel better than me.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2e4dd926a77334c56bc137e9fa74bab6, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: All you have to do is take a right at the end of the hallway.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 92833f74e835d4ad6a1f1d64cde962e1, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Go on. Room 8 is right waiting.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8236314d228cd4624ab99dbda28f2943, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: RightJunctionBackward
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: RightJunctionBackward
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: This is an empty room.
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: There is nothing here.
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: You should go back to the hallway.
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: What are you looking at? It's empty!
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: RightJunctionBackward
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: RightJunctionBackward
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    - variableKey: BackwardCount
      comparison: 1
      value: 3
    narrations:
    - text: You just love going backward. Don't you?
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: There is nothing there.
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Go back.
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: What are you looking at? It's empty!
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: HallwayBackward
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: HallwayBackward
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    - variableKey: BackwardCount
      comparison: 4
      value: 100
    narrations:
    - text: Hold on. Why are you going back?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 72f307acc1fe2408f83222944ace6511, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: No. No. You're not supposed to go back.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 43297bd2c7e734992a227688cf8d2483, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Turn around!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 39d60843df50b48db91efb2f75994d77, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Come on, dude. I told you a million times. Wrong way!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4920f56b8b3dc48169ac19a9f6a9ba3b, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: You just LOVE going back, don't you?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9837f269a5f7c442b9f3c78c6f851f6e, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: 'You understand English right? Like words? '
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0f70ae84a96a04dacb542c2aff3dc8d8, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: You know what. Go back as much as you like.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f2177a8280aab47ea9bdff902f840b57, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 1
    - text: Let a mantis eat you for all I care.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 387184ce7413849a2a5e73c7ee008724, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: HallwayBackwardTooMuch
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: HallwayBackward
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    - variableKey: BackwardCount
      comparison: 1
      value: 100
    narrations:
    - text: Back on track!
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Deliver your damn pizza!
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: HallwayForward2
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: HallwayForward2
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: Alright!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0bcc3e83e4f6041589c2b64f00b27596, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: This time, take the right turns.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: da40d0b001aff45fa940bbbeeed9716b, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: "\_No shenanigans like last time."
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 880945b6392c044b9bf18c8cece91ae3, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: You must be wondering about the missing flowers from that vase, huh?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e47f21459852c4235ae4a01f9ba95895, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Well, I took them for my wife. She loves when I bring flowers on our
        dates.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bdcb79d64d5094e14bd5c7bd5b3bb6bc, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: I only see her once a year, you know.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c1a41fbe7c1e43d581373998aed729d, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: You must think this is a weird hotel? With a weird Bell boy?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 65af264b84b45452b818faec127b6a0d, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: It's only weird if you make it weird, you know.
      clip: {fileID: 0}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: I think it's a lovely hotel. Some residents are weird though.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7417d4c1191c84850a93f101fa3d3d0d, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: The weirdest one is the big dude with the tiny magician hat.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7f4c206b7c44f4d7ca8889e3613c1987, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: DO NOT COME NEAR HIM.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 106502cc0082148aea10c2bf7ebcda78, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: HallwayBackward2
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: HallwayBackward2
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: How many times do I have to tell you to not go back?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ffc9d1205a0d042ab85f60645ab6d471, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: I just don't understand.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d9565d54a3a5a4994a86c34bc703d800, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Why do you keep going back?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01b0ec179e7fb4c1ab1c064e9409c377, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: There is nothing back there.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b7f5c1dd3ab5c4a1387a83608a361fa9, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: You go back so many times I'm starting to think you're not alright in
        the head.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f495ffba50fd045f2aa095d79668d895, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: LoopForward
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: LoopForward
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: 'Ok, story time! What do you think of this place? '
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 406cf2c503abd43c492f6ab242f45d27, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Would you live here?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f4ba7216d81b8461cb0a787fb2f0a2ac, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: 'You know... I built the whole thing myself. '
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2eed2654f6fcc43d1bb5bb280ad8e081, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: 'I built this place with my own precious hands. Brick by brick. '
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3757da38128fb4e8298a4bdf4b396404, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: I installed every lamp and placed every piece of furniture myself.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 99a1f4734401b4c1dbd478308d67a866, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: It ain't much, but it's honest work.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ca24bc8e8f9044ff1973b6d37605f429, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Don't you feel welcomed and at ease?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4fcaa20d126e74e2081a832528776dcd, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: I think the residents of this place would say so.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 14a634ff85a6c4169827d09f8013000f, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: LoopBackward
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: LoopBackward
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: No. No. Oh my god...
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e26e8186d246e4c428acb5c47f4a8415, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Do you not understand the concept of a hallway?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0b416548695624309bbd045ae9da2f08, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: In a hallway, you walk forward to get to a destination.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 957cad6756e00462e8f61f8a69a3c5c9, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Extremely simple.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 27a63b7ad6926476ab960f4b5894d743, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: TURN AROUND!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 39d60843df50b48db91efb2f75994d77, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 1
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: LoopForward1
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: LoopForward1
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: "Wait. No... this isn\u2019t the way."
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 239286ee437d444039072dfed1f9fab6, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: 'You must have made the wrong turn. '
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b541a87a475594157aff69424e2222a8, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: 'Let me describe it to you in a way you understand. '
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4d3660ad630524efe91ca2b5d440dc59, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Just follow the damn hallway. Can't be hard.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c26ed542e5f064b6999a241d67ebd9d8, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Don't even think of going back.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1d9a38958bf0143b9b09780b478632d9, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: LoopBackward1
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: LoopBackward1
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: Did I not tell you to not go back?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4dde7b7bf76ae4e25a18b5e732217070, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: LoopForward2
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: LoopForward2
      comparison: 0
