  - channelName: LoopF2
    priority: 10
    conditions:
    - variableKey: LoopF2
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: How peculiar.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f734d68f28ce3460d8d9044f79cf4af3, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Something has changed.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 291bfbbb0f787451fb56a204deef2184, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Can you get closer to that thing on the right?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6dae2a34179e645898dcdbdc8ddc6ef5, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Do you think everything looks the same as last time we were here?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bce85204793ca4410ac490c99654f480, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: You know what. Never mind I'm probably just tired.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5f678f031116b4e35a290b1aa9ea7450, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: I probably should get some coffee. I think I will.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7cb07fde4c503414c9a2c8868af060c4, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: LoopB2
    priority: 7
    conditions:
    - variableKey: LoopB2
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: Whoah whoah! Hold on. Stand still.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b22dc60056e724ee095a783b0c7d885a, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Can you step backwards?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c3724b19fbf484f3d91a7707a2c54078, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Another one please.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1dc2e51acfdf14eb6a6ded81af5522cc, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 1
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: LoopSolved
    priority: 7
    conditions:
    - variableKey: LoopSolved
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: Aha!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cb4b0fa1b39e942c1b96bf731b84fa07, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: That's why you were stuck.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c8c3ef496bbb746628a8de2785e20949, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Now you should be unstuck.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f01f0a654b2bd4b6fb943a716e7b9de0, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Just follow the hallway, and you will find room 8.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0362ea69ecd2441659eae91b2a04b49c, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Mr. Marid Washwashni must be very hungry and waiting for his pizza!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bf4ce968f31f84656b7bf299f9b28aad, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: HallwayForward3
    priority: 9
    conditions:
    - variableKey: HallwayForward3
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: 'STOP! '
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 92a8ba0497e684618b89cf9292ccaf88, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Did I tell you about the magician with the tiny hat?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 959cb3c07dd58410686634714440e17b, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: The one who eats humans?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 151ab6a0e00ea4ad28722f4eb15264fe, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: He can't see or smell, but he hears human breathing.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0fb739c1f4b6d43e0a5b1f7562323c55, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: I'd love to tell you more but there is no time. You're sharing a hallway.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e8b0aa0d3f28645629aabcdad4d2fdf1, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Now, there is a room on the left.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 089478b934b7041d79cbf418e75f0b7c, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: If you hold your breath and move slowly, he won't notice you.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bdb466b98894d459883421390184ccfe, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Now, slowly. You can't hold your breath any longer.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b5938fe4e36f34a54affa103483fbb01, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: HallwayBackward3
    priority: 9
    conditions:
    - variableKey: HallwayBackward3
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: DO NOT GO BACK. The creature will eat you.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c39589a1b888549768597c05445d5cf6, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Keep going back and you're going to become magician meat.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 30e60bed0157b48ad8e46008f7d43f48, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Alright, enjoy becoming a meal.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b9652d7e273674794a12cf1b7c9fce7c, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: PuzzleFail
    priority: 7
    conditions:
    - variableKey: PuzzleFail
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: Haa! Solve it right, focus!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e905a040a54f949739b343da98248ce3, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Alright, I'll play it for you again.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5adb52d72648b41e8979388962d5da64, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 1
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: KidsRoom
    priority: 7
    conditions:
    - variableKey: KidsRoom
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: "Do you see the look on your face? You\u2019re probably thinking, \"Why
        are we here...\""
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e3984906952cf4621a0112cf8246d6ce, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Oh, do you know that Arabic song?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 009bad2bb01f1437383303a4c06ffddc, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: "Well, it\u2019s the only one we have recorded anyway. Let me play it
        for you...\n"
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aab267e6148164a60b7b0291c00ed6ff, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7e8c2068657fd4ceda0f8b17745e2100, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: PuzzleSuccess
    priority: 9
    conditions:
    - variableKey: PuzzleSuccess
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: Bravooooo! I'm proud of you!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c5d5177cea3e94bf2ab74fa518f32b72, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Alright, what do you say we hang out together?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4d8780c8e78d3419a9572138033682cc, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Get out of this room! I will be in room 8, which is just around the corner.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2b332025917984e1688c17c760458878, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: PuzzleResume
    priority: 7
    conditions:
    - variableKey: PuzzleResume
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: 
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7e8c2068657fd4ceda0f8b17745e2100, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 1
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: EarlyLoopSolve
    priority: 9
    conditions:
    - variableKey: EarlyLoopSolve
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: Who told you about the vase? You solved it too quick!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c96017adce75c4108b8bc6409b59a434, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: You must've watched it in a YouTube tutorial
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 17d4d21c4f77045e39a8b7ce2d7ef13d, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: You cheated, though. Cheating is haram.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 370ea9febaf49484888991ce63e764dd, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Come on, go ahead. You must know the way as well.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d92793b6f82e24f3fa74c80b97f99463, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: You're in for a surprise at the reception.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae57094e7fd574e76b4c7767bb50a297, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    restartOnActivate: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  transitions:
  - label: 
    fromChannel: HallwayBackward
    toChannel: HallwayForward
    narrations:
    - text: Good. Where were we? Ah, yes!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7900182c1b1c048c383c87951d339a91, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    - text: There you are. As I was saying...
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 06cc10e3e58bc49c2adef913bbd9feae, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    - text: Alright, back to it!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: df1ccb77ff59247e7afcce7386db40a0, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    - text: Okay... Before you so rudely interrupted me... I was saying...
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 12daea20196054e0d9acd6b0b71206ef, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    linesPerSwitch: 1
    loop: 1
  - label: 
    fromChannel: EmptyRoom1
    toChannel: HallwayForward
    narrations:
    - text: Alright, back to it!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: df1ccb77ff59247e7afcce7386db40a0, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    - text: There you are. As I was saying...
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 06cc10e3e58bc49c2adef913bbd9feae, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    - text: Good. Where were we? Ah, yes!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7900182c1b1c048c383c87951d339a91, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    - text: Okay... Before you so rudely interrupted me... I was saying...
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 12daea20196054e0d9acd6b0b71206ef, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    linesPerSwitch: 1
    loop: 1
  - label: 
    fromChannel: LoopBackward
    toChannel: LoopForward
    narrations:
    - text: Alright, back to it!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: df1ccb77ff59247e7afcce7386db40a0, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    - text: There you are. As I was saying...
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 06cc10e3e58bc49c2adef913bbd9feae, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    - text: Good. Where were we? Ah, yes!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7900182c1b1c048c383c87951d339a91, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    - text: Okay... Before you so rudely interrupted me... I was saying...
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 12daea20196054e0d9acd6b0b71206ef, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    linesPerSwitch: 1
    loop: 1
  - label: 
    fromChannel: LoopBackward1
    toChannel: LoopForward1
    narrations:
    - text: Alright, back to it!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: df1ccb77ff59247e7afcce7386db40a0, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    - text: There you are. As I was saying...
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 06cc10e3e58bc49c2adef913bbd9feae, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    - text: Good. Where were we? Ah, yes!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7900182c1b1c048c383c87951d339a91, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    - text: Okay... Before you so rudely interrupted me... I was saying...
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 12daea20196054e0d9acd6b0b71206ef, type: 3}
      mustComplete: 0
    linesPerSwitch: 1
    loop: 1
  idleNarrations:
  - text: Are you gonna move?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b69e51b23a72949fbbd83829122a99f5, type: 3}
    mustComplete: 0
  - text: You're not gonna just stand there, are you?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 46b2e4edb51024eb6a924f1731992260, type: 3}
    mustComplete: 1
  - text: You know this would be boring if you don't do anything?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 28ba010a22d22403d88dc4749a63124f, type: 3}
    mustComplete: 1
  - text: Move, please!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8d34f4c5112eb43d5a49bf0d728eece1, type: 3}
    mustComplete: 0
  - text: Security! I'll call security if you don't move.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d86c8733566804baf8352908d200f8fa, type: 3}
    mustComplete: 1
  - text: You're lucky the security guy is nowhere to be found. Move...or I'll come
      get you myself.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8911a2703da5c44bf879dde4b6916d75, type: 3}
    mustComplete: 1
  lineDuration: 4
